{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Didi and Jeong Tae-woong's Yomojomo of Korean Life"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Didi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Jeong Tae-woong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo of Korean Life is a podcast where two people living in Korea talk about the various aspects of Korean life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, and today is the ninth episode, already the ninth episode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What was today's topic?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, already the ninth episode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today's topic is elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're going to talk about our elementary school days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, let me briefly explain the Korean education system structure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Korea, it's structured as six years of elementary school, three years of middle school, and three years of high school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. It's a long time if you think of it as long, and short if you think of it as short."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, so among those, elementary school is the longest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Six years. Six years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teacher Tae-woong, which elementary school did you graduate from?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I moved several times,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I attended three different elementary schools."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when I started in first grade, I enrolled at an elementary school in Haeundae, Busan,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and around the end of first grade, to a place called Jecheon in Chungcheongbuk-do, Korea,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Suddenly?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At that time, my family moved because of my father's work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it was so out of the blue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jecheon?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, in a place called Jecheon in Chungcheongbuk-do, I attended elementary school from around second grade."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then at the end of fifth grade,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You attended for a long time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I attended for a long time, and around the end of fifth grade I came back to Busan,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I graduated from a school in Busan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it a different place from your first school?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You transferred schools a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I transferred once too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I attended two different schools during elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was in Daegu until fifth grade,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and for the last fifth and sixth grades I moved to Gyeonggi-do and attended school here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And after that you've been living in Gyeonggi-do the whole time?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After that I've been in Gyeonggi-do the whole time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I only transferred schools during elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's been quite a while since you've lived in Gyeonggi-do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's been a while."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's been even longer now, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've lived here longer than I lived in Daegu."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teacher Tae-woong, so when you transferred, were you okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you adapt well?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then I didn't know anything,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I first went from Busan,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was when I was eight years old in first grade,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So eight years old in Korean age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What, like seven years old?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So around six or seven years old."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then I didn't know anything,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I think I just adapted very naturally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you ever get teased because of the dialect?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I remember that, but I didn't get teased."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the friends I first met back then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, he uses dialect like that so much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was it interesting?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I remember doing it that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's kind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were really kind friends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You must have been the same way, right Didi?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because you use dialect in Daegu."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't have friends who made fun of me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there were friends who would kind of say \"this guy is a bit weird.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, you know, it's like that kind of thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because the way of speaking and words are a bit different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like \"natning-gu\" or something. \"Merry has.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's that? It's \"nat,\" right? In standard Korean it's \"nat.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when I speak using dialect words"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they would just laugh a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They didn't make fun of me, but there were friends who laughed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when you think back to elementary school, how does it feel?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For me, it was really different between when I went to school in Daegu and when I went in Gyeonggi Province"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I was in Daegu, I liked studying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wanted to be good at studying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wanted to be first, I had a lot of ambition about studying back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In elementary school?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I studied the hardest in elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I just liked being praised."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when I'd rank like top few in the whole school"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I liked seeing my parents be happy about it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I studied hard, but when you're young studying is easy, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tests are easy things anyway"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was doing well, but as I went up grades it got harder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No matter how much I studied, I couldn't do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So gradually I couldn't get the grades I wanted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and right at that moment we moved to Gyeonggi Province"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had to adapt and also the friends I used to play with were different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and because of all this, they weren't friends who studied."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I came here, they were just ordinary friends who liked to play"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and from then on, I think I stopped studying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You were influenced by your friends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's part of it, or maybe I was adapting to the environment?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, that's impressive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You wanted to be good at studying back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then I really had a lot of ambition. About studying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, because I had a best friend back then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was on the third floor and that friend lived a bit higher up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We were friends in the same apartment so we played all the time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that friend was good at studying. My best friend."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I was definitely influenced a lot by that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was kind of like a rivalry, I had to win."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had to do better than you, that kind of feeling, I think that's why."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the way, that friend became a teacher now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By continuing to study hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Definitely when you're young you get influenced a lot by the friends around you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. That's everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How was it for you, Teacher Tae-woong? In elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really had no thoughts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You had no thoughts?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Like the level of an old cat or dog?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To that extent?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you look at cats, they know how to open doors, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I was at that kind of level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd just eat whatever food came out, play when there was time to play, and take tests when told to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when my mom sent me to hagwons, I'd go to hagwons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My mom sent me to taekwondo, so I went to taekwondo hagwon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when my mom taught me piano, I'd practice piano."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Were you a well-behaved cat?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why didn't you listen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I was really unusual."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even when I really didn't want to do something, I wouldn't throw a tantrum or get angry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd just endure it and do it reluctantly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really? You didn't cleverly avoid doing it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because of that, I'd show up consistently, but I wouldn't work hard once I was there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Same with hagwons and school?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. It was always a series of enduring for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You were an enduring cat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, once the 50-minute class time ends, there's break time, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "40 minutes left. 30 minutes left."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's when I learned what patience is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The way to endure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. So I'm good at waiting and things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think that's also an important part of education."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Teacher Taeyong, which hagwons did you go to in elementary school?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In elementary school, I went to a seodang."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A seodang? What year were you born?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A seodang is..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A seodang? What kind of place is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was a place in Korea called a seodang."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not sure if it still exists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a term from the Joseon era, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. It's a hagwon that teaches Chinese characters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, so that's what they called a seodang."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a Chinese character hagwon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. That's right. A Chinese character hagwon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I even remember the name. It was called Imun Seodang."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it was next to that school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you went to Imun Seodang, you'd sit on the floor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with the seodang teacher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600000,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Korean learners learn Korean Chinese characters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603060,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cheonjamun, Myeongshimbogyeom?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607040,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, it wasn't Myeongshimbogyeom, but anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610180,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, we'd really write and memorize Chinese characters like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614740,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did things like that first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616980,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then, Chinese characters were important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618700,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even when we were in elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620020,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. They were much more important than now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623240,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've forgotten it all now though."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627980,
    "dDurationMs": 3899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, I went to a Chinese character hagwon like that too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631879,
    "dDurationMs": 8601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I went to taekwondo hagwon for a really long time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640480,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you go from age 7 straight through?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644520,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Until when?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645560,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Until before high school entrance?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651040,
    "dDurationMs": 1239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You really went for a long time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652279,
    "dDurationMs": 2921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the first time I've met someone who went for that long."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655220,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. So for reference, I'm a 4th dan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659660,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. A black belt holder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662540,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are ranks starting from 1st dan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666300,
    "dDurationMs": 2119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1st dan, 2nd dan, 3rd dan, 4th dan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668419,
    "dDurationMs": 2841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got up to 4th dan like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671260,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So with 4th dan, you can become an instructor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675180,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It suits you really well. Instructor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677220,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really? That's interesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679260,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hear people say that kind of thing often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681180,
    "dDurationMs": 3519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It suits you really well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684720,
    "dDurationMs": 2479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it doesn't suit me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687199,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Usually in Korea, taekwondo is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690519,
    "dDurationMs": 3281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something kids do because they have so much energy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693800,
    "dDurationMs": 3079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and after school, kind of to kill time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696879,
    "dDurationMs": 2561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and get some exercise, so parents send them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699440,
    "dDurationMs": 3479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it seems like a lot of friends went during elementary school,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702919,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you went all the way through middle and high school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706199,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not high school,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708879,
    "dDurationMs": 1281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just up until right before high school?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710160,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I went until middle school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713099,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And actually, in high school"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716019,
    "dDurationMs": 2521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there was a taekwondo class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718540,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At school?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719300,
    "dDurationMs": 4119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I'll tell you about that later in the high school episode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723419,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in first year of high school, I got my 4th dan instructor rank."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728059,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To that extent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730259,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's awesome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731339,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway. Anyway, and."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733539,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay. Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734179,
    "dDurationMs": 4761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then English hagwon, math hagwon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738940,
    "dDurationMs": 7020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And was it when you graduated elementary school?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 745960,
    "dDurationMs": 5079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No. You went to drum hagwon in middle school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751039,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. And I can't remember any other hagwons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753199,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about piano?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754119,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Huh?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754919,
    "dDurationMs": 521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Piano."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755440,
    "dDurationMs": 4679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. Piano was something my mother"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760119,
    "dDurationMs": 4481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I was really young in Busan, at a piano teaching place,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764600,
    "dDurationMs": 1959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a piano hagwon that she ran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766559,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow. Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767919,
    "dDurationMs": 4581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So back then my older sister and I, mom made us do it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772500,
    "dDurationMs": 3399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I wasn't very diligent about it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775899,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I really didn't want to do it, so I was just going through the motions half-heartedly, and it was so obvious"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781339,
    "dDurationMs": 2881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that she stopped making me do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784220,
    "dDurationMs": 1839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She tried for a bit and then stopped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786059,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really? You can't play piano now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787979,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789940,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really regret it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793300,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If only I'd stuck with it a bit more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795300,
    "dDurationMs": 599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795899,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess I really hated piano."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797800,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I should have stuck with it properly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800440,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And also, if my mother had been teaching me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 803240,
    "dDurationMs": 1879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wouldn't I have been less half-hearted about it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805119,
    "dDurationMs": 1401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 806520,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because it wouldn't have been scary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808080,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810880,
    "dDurationMs": 1959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, that's how it was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812839,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about you, Didi?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814479,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I went to something a bit unusual, kind of like a traditional study room,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819679,
    "dDurationMs": 1121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I learned the abacus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820800,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822000,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823240,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you actually learned that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825880,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like this abacus. What do you call it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827740,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A calculator. A traditional calculator."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831860,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I learned that, and through it I learned mental math."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835860,
    "dDurationMs": 3559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So even now when I do mental math, I use the abacus method."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839419,
    "dDurationMs": 2681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's really amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842100,
    "dDurationMs": 799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The abacus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842899,
    "dDurationMs": 4121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I heard calculations with that are really fast?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847020,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848660,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, you can really do it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850660,
    "dDurationMs": 5039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, like big numbers like 63,000, I can't do those."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855720,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just simple ones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857040,
    "dDurationMs": 3799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like when calculating how much money came in, things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860839,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863119,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are some interesting academies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865799,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I went to an abacus academy back when I was studying hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870239,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Daegu."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870839,
    "dDurationMs": 4361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "64 hundred is 37 plus 25."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875200,
    "dDurationMs": 1599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "52?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 876799,
    "dDurationMs": 401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877200,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877880,
    "dDurationMs": 440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878320,
    "dDurationMs": 639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We should check."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878959,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We need to verify that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880399,
    "dDurationMs": 1321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's how it works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881720,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885500,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You seem like a genius."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886820,
    "dDurationMs": 1519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 888339,
    "dDurationMs": 1881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It could be wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890220,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, that's shocking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892220,
    "dDurationMs": 3959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, I went to abacus academy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 896179,
    "dDurationMs": 1761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I took piano lessons too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897940,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I played piano throughout elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900660,
    "dDurationMs": 2199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what else did I do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 902859,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Art academy. I went to art academy too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905059,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 906299,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I went to art academy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909619,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for quite a long time before I started elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 913279,
    "dDurationMs": 5041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for sports, I did swimming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 918320,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, you did good things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920480,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I learned swimming for about 2 or 3 years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926720,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's about what I remember."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928040,
    "dDurationMs": 3199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I probably went to math academy and English academy too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931239,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Looking at it this way, Korean elementary school kids really live busily, don't they?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937079,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938839,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's busy. When do you play?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940519,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think that's been the case since my generation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 945579,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946899,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't you think so?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950179,
    "dDurationMs": 2201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From what I've heard,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952380,
    "dDurationMs": 4399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our parents' generation had nothing to do when they were young"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 956779,
    "dDurationMs": 4321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there was a lot of longing to learn things like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961100,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they wanted their children to learn piano"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964019,
    "dDurationMs": 7461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and learn sports and things like that, or so I've heard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971480,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Parents' hearts seem to be similar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 975359,
    "dDurationMs": 4081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now, on the other hand, people of my generation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979440,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "might think they should let their kids play, I think there are parents like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985880,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hope there are many parents like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990760,
    "dDurationMs": 3539,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Teacher Tae-woong, in the midst of all that continuous struggle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994299,
    "dDurationMs": 4801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what time did you like the most? When you were in elementary school?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999100,
    "dDurationMs": 1759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you play games back then?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000859,
    "dDurationMs": 4121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I did play games."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004980,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "MapleStory?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005980,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I played MapleStory for a bit but then quit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010100,
    "dDurationMs": 3679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because the levels wouldn't go up and it was frustrating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013779,
    "dDurationMs": 2481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I quit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1016260,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then, levels really didn't go up easily."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018559,
    "dDurationMs": 4161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. It seems different these days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022720,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I couldn't play StarCraft because I didn't know English."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027480,
    "dDurationMs": 1319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were a lot of walls."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028799,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, and I think I did a lot of other things too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032399,
    "dDurationMs": 8120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back in the day, there were Flash games, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040519,
    "dDurationMs": 3481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just Flash games you'd access through the internet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044000,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, those were popular. Everyone played them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046500,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I played a lot of those kinds of games."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1048700,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And my parents didn't really restrict games or anything like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054940,
    "dDurationMs": 6760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They let me play pretty freely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1061700,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So back then they even bought me CDs like White Heart Dressing Room games."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1068140,
    "dDurationMs": 6599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when Harry Potter 1 came out, they bought that for me too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1074760,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And all the happy times were times unrelated to school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079440,
    "dDurationMs": 1839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1081279,
    "dDurationMs": 2441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I liked putting together Legos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1083720,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, I even went to a Lego academy for a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086160,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was an academy for that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088760,
    "dDurationMs": 3599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, something like Utopia? I don't remember the name well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092359,
    "dDurationMs": 4681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You'd go and make Legos and that kind of academy, I guess you'd call it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097040,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A play room?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097640,
    "dDurationMs": 1719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spending time, yes that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1099380,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thinking about it now, a play room? Like a kids' cafe feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1105140,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You liked Legos?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106540,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, so I would put together Legos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1109820,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with those assembled Legos, I would spread my wings of imagination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1115580,
    "dDurationMs": 3599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Playing with imagination was the most fun for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1119179,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122659,
    "dDurationMs": 3481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I liked drawing pictures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126140,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126900,
    "dDurationMs": 1199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1128119,
    "dDurationMs": 1321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know that old thing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1129440,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Drawing games in a notebook."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1131840,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did that a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1134520,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right? Notebook games."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136760,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Drawing pictures and items and all that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1138679,
    "dDurationMs": 1721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140400,
    "dDurationMs": 3639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was a really key person. I was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1144039,
    "dDurationMs": 1281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In charge of development?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1145320,
    "dDurationMs": 2599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I was in charge of development."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147919,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you were an idea bank from back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149719,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1152559,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you draw pictures too? What kind of pictures?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155820,
    "dDurationMs": 4799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, monsters, swords, things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1160619,
    "dDurationMs": 2761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's cute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1163380,
    "dDurationMs": 2799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you had that kind of time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1166179,
    "dDurationMs": 3521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because I really liked those kinds of things,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1169700,
    "dDurationMs": 3919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my mother even took me to an art academy once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1173619,
    "dDurationMs": 1201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then what?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1174820,
    "dDurationMs": 4279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it wasn't the kind of art I wanted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1179099,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I wanted to draw monsters but they told me to draw apples."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1182099,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1184239,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you gave up again, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1187200,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You gave up, didn't you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188200,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1191200,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wish I'd been born 30 years later."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194640,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1195640,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, to pursue my interests more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Host Didi's Korean Culture Podcast is like a door to expand Korean language materials, you could say?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1209000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a lot more of that these days. Back then there wasn't much like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1215000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Go ahead and expand freely now, Teacher Tae-woong. It's not too late."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1219000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm working hard on it these days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1222000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good. So when you think back to elementary school, do you only have memories of playing like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1231000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I heard you were really popular in elementary school, Teacher Tae-woong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1237000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, that's right. I was really popular when I was in elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1242000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I asked if you were good at running, but apparently that wasn't it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1247000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back in elementary school, the boys who were good at running and played soccer were the popular ones. Because they were active and all that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1257000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was active, though."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1260000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And had lots of friends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1262000,
    "dDurationMs": 16000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Had lots of friends. And how should I put it? It wasn't just in elementary school for me—it was like that all the way through middle and high school too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1278000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was generally close friends with all the boys in my class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1288000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We'll talk about this in more detail later in the middle and high school episode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1293000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You were a total insider."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1296000,
    "dDurationMs": 12000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it wasn't like I was outgoing and talkative in that insider way—it was more like, \"Hey, he gets along with everyone,\" that kind of feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1308000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, \"He's cool with everyone,\" that kind of vibe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1313000,
    "dDurationMs": 14000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I think carefully about why I was so popular, besides my looks, I don't think there was anything particularly special."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1327000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You must have been incredibly cute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that was it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1331000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Please send me a photo, Teacher Tae-woong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1333000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I looked for photos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1335000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't have any?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I only have them from when I was in kindergarten."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1339000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's fine. Show me little Tae-woong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1342000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Understood. Should I send you the photo? Or should I show you now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1346000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me see first. It's hard to see. You're cute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1352000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can't you see it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1353000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're cute. You look like a rich kid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1356000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that so?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1357000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That kind of feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1358000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have dimples."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1361000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you melted the hearts of elementary schoolers with those dimples."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1365000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, you can see it on all elementary schoolers' faces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1369000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But was it because of the dimples?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1371000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's interesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1373000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. I wasn't good at soccer, and I wasn't good at running."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1383000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you had a good personality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1385000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My personality didn't seem to have any weak points. In elementary school. I seemed to have no weak points in elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1394000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I was good at singing... oh, I did sing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1399000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why did you sing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was in the choir."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I was in the choir. The school choir."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1408000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That school choir went to competitions and won awards and all that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1412000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1414000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think it was mostly because I was cute-looking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1419000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the older girls in the choir really liked me too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So why I'm talking about being popular is—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1428000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Honestly, if I just say I was popular, it could be my imagination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1433000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The reason I remember it that way is—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1436000,
    "dDurationMs": 16000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every single year, on Valentine's Day, White Day, Pepero Day, and all those days, my desk was full of gifts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just your desk, Teacher Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1454000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1457000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's wrong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1459000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm envious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1462000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So really, every school year, every single year there was some kind of day like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1469000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every occasion where we'd exchange snacks and gifts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1473000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I always used to stack them up on my desk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1477000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You could say I admired them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1482000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd build them up like a tower to show off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1485000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see. Really, that's something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1487000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. That's what I did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1490000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you do things like being class president?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1492000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Class president. I don't think I ever did it in elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1498000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wasn't that noticeable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1501000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. So I didn't step forward."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1505000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess I must have been pretty cute back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1507000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1510000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My older sister talks about that a lot too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1513000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She says I was really cute when I was little, but look at me now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1521000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1522000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now it's just like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1525000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those were completely happy times, weren't they?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1527000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You didn't have a girlfriend? In elementary school?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1530000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think I did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1534000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1536000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did I?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1539000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you were so popular?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1541000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's why you didn't?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1545000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You just enjoyed it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1546000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1548000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about your girl friends?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1551000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then I got along well with all the boys."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1554000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I had a lot of girl friends too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1558000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were quite a few wild kids too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1563000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You had wild kids around you from elementary school?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1565000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I only had them around me in elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1568000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1574000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I probably have the most memories from Jecheon. Still."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1577000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I think that was the most fun time in my life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1584000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you remember that? Trampolines and stuff like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1587000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you call it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1589000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I called it a trampoline too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1591000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Daegu they call it a bongbong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1594000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some places call it bongbong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1597000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It varies by region. Some places call it a sangtang."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1600000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1602000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trampoline? It's a trampoline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1604000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Trampoline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1607000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We did a lot of that stuff. And we'd buy street food and eat it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1611000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. Pikachu."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1613000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we'd buy 100 won, 200 won snacks from the stationery store."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1619000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Junk food?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1620000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Junk food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1622000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We ate a lot of that stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1624000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Chakhani tastes good. They still exist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1626000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Chakhani tastes good. It's like a really big Cheetos flavor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1630000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. That's right. Chakhani."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1633000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I remember is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1636000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I was in elementary school in Jecheon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1642000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My cousin's house was right in front of an elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1647000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was my uncle's house."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1649000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I went to play at my uncle's house."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1652000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My uncle gave me a 5,000 won bill as pocket money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1658000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I received it and was so excited."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1660000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I thought I should spend all the money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1665000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I went right to the stationery shop in front of that school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1668000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I bought the most expensive junk food snack."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1672000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was it 1,000 won?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1677000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How cute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1678000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. So I didn't even spend half the money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1681000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as soon as I came out of the stationery shop with the snack I bought."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1685000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I tore open the wrapper right at the entrance and ate it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1690000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I couldn't even finish half of it because I got full."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1695000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You were just a little kid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1696000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1699000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then, even with just 5,000 won, you couldn't spend it all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1704000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1709000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The prices were really different back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1711000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1712000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Things have changed so much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1717000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But back then, just 500 won was enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1722000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1724000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You could buy things like tteokbokki."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1726000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was it 300 won? Cup tteokbokki like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1729000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. In a paper cup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1731000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We really did use it. That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1733000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You transferred schools a lot, didn't you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1736000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1737000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you not have any memories of feeling sad or regretful about it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1744000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1745000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not sure. It seems like I might have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1748000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really? Do you still keep in touch with any friends from Jecheon?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1753000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1754000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Doesn't that feel a bit unfortunate to you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1756000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't have childhood friends like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1758000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Me too. Me too. Me too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1760000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That feels a bit unfortunate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1763000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I understand. I also don't have that and it feels a bit unfortunate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1769000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But back when I was that young, there was no way to keep in contact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1778000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Email was the only thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1780000,
    "dDurationMs": 11000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. So when I transferred from Jecheon back to Busan in fifth grade of elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1791000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I remember exchanging emails with about two or three friends from Jecheon at that time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1801000,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then when I was adjusting to the new place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1804160,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, we did it a couple of times and then stopped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1807360,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think we forgot about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1809560,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But kids these days wouldn't have that, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1812520,
    "dDurationMs": 5279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now everything is just connected through SNS."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1817799,
    "dDurationMs": 2441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You just have to follow them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1820240,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that is romantic in a way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1824400,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the romance of our time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1828120,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I still sometimes miss those days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1831280,
    "dDurationMs": 2999,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really? You miss the time when there was no SNS like this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1834279,
    "dDurationMs": 2081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1836360,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1838400,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1840680,
    "dDurationMs": 5079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It means there's a complete end to a relationship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1845759,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because that complete end can happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1852599,
    "dDurationMs": 4881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The way you treat that relationship can be different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1857560,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1858560,
    "dDurationMs": 3559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I often think about things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1862119,
    "dDurationMs": 2641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A time when I valued relationships a bit more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1864760,
    "dDurationMs": 1199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1865959,
    "dDurationMs": 3761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1869720,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've been talking too much about things outside of school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1873400,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that so?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1874480,
    "dDurationMs": 8079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Didi, you asked me earlier—when was your happiest time?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1882559,
    "dDurationMs": 6881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I was younger, I was very different from now—I was really active."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1889440,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I liked doing active things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1892320,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So probably in the summer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1897480,
    "dDurationMs": 7320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after eating dinner with my mom and older brother, we'd always go out to the sports field."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1904800,
    "dDurationMs": 2159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that was my favorite time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1906959,
    "dDurationMs": 4361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My mom would exercise and walk while exercising,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1911320,
    "dDurationMs": 3279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and my older brother and I would play with cloud ladders and things like that—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1914599,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "equipment that was at the sports field—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1919879,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we'd do things like jump rope and hang from the horizontal bar,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1923879,
    "dDurationMs": 1841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I liked those kinds of things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1925720,
    "dDurationMs": 2559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We'd do jungle gyms and things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1928279,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's pure childhood innocence itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1930240,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1931720,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is also a story from when I was in lower grades,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1934800,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and as I got older, did you start liking playing with friends?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1939320,
    "dDurationMs": 2439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1941759,
    "dDurationMs": 4201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I also liked drawing pictures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1945960,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In elementary school, I think I wanted to be a cartoonist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1949000,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1950080,
    "dDurationMs": 1559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had several dreams,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1951639,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I think I liked drawing those kinds of comics and things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1954119,
    "dDurationMs": 3761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1957880,
    "dDurationMs": 3239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fact that you did that from when you were young"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1961119,
    "dDurationMs": 2841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then became a web designer and illustrator—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1963960,
    "dDurationMs": 4599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do you think there's some connection?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1968559,
    "dDurationMs": 5321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've always been confident about drawing pictures,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1973880,
    "dDurationMs": 3399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or rather, since I could do it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1977279,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't really dislike it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1978479,
    "dDurationMs": 3041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so anyway,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1981520,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I was submitting applications,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1983000,
    "dDurationMs": 4839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I thought, well, wouldn't a design major be okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1987839,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From when I was young, I never really disliked it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1992279,
    "dDurationMs": 1441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Elementary school—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1993720,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do you have mostly good memories overall?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1998320,
    "dDurationMs": 1959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2000279,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2001399,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I look at elementary, middle, and high school together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2003800,
    "dDurationMs": 2959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I have the most good memories from elementary school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2006759,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2009479,
    "dDurationMs": 1241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2010720,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Time didn't pass really slowly back then, did it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2013440,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2014600,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One year really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2017520,
    "dDurationMs": 2319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "felt like five years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2019839,
    "dDurationMs": 5521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, time seemed to pass differently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2025360,
    "dDurationMs": 3479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when I was in elementary school,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2028839,
    "dDurationMs": 3321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had to go to school on Saturdays too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2032160,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2033240,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2034320,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2036240,
    "dDurationMs": 599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2036839,
    "dDurationMs": 1241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was that also the case?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2038080,
    "dDurationMs": 5679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then when I got to around sixth grade,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2043759,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every other Saturday, I didn't go to school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2049919,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, we finished school early on Saturdays."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2054119,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We only went until the fourth period, at lunchtime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2057279,
    "dDurationMs": 2641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'd go home early."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2059920,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because of that, the week felt really long."
